JSONL Format (Recommended)CSV Format <p>Each line contains a JSON object with the sequence and its annotations: <pre><code>{"sequence": "ATCGATCG...", "label": [1,0,1,0,1,...], "id": "seq_001"}
{"sequence": "GCTAGCTA...", "label": [0,1,0,1,0,...], "id": "seq_002"}
</code></pre></p> <p>Tabular format with columns for sequence, labels, and metadata:</p> <pre><code>id,sequence,label,chromosome,start,end
seq_001,ATCGATCG...,"1,0,1,0,1",chr1,1000,1500
seq_002,GCTAGCTA...,"0,1,0,1,0",chr2,2000,2500
</code></pre>
